<title>POLAND: All Polish minimum T-bill prices fall at tender.</title>
<headline>All Polish minimum T-bill prices fall at tender.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minimum prices of all Polish T-bills fell at today's primary auction on total demand of 911 million zlotys against a 1.1 billion zloty offer, the finance ministry said.</p>
</text>
